  write needs both the CLI flag and ENABLE_GRAPH_DB_WRITE=true.

RQ-03 (no trigger/registration matrix; cloud judge implied working)
  Resolved. New page operations/entrypoint-matrix.md. It states that git_gate.py::GATES has 23 entries
  and excludes check_plan_package_compat.py, check_prompt_trace_assets.py, sync_wiki_to_graph.py,
  real_driver_ablation.py and every TypeScript gate; that weekly_audit.yml runs only ablation_engine.py;
  that autoresearch_eval.yml passes the string "true" while cloud_judge() only activates on "1", and
  that even then it returns a placeholder SKIP with no API call; and that validate_goal_constraints.py
  and validate_commit_message.py run argument-less under git_gate so only their selftest path is proven.
  github_skill_harvester.py, sample_autoresearch_traces.py and test_plan_package_compat.sh each get a
  named canonical home.

RQ-04 (gemini quarantine and real-driver boundary had no home)
  Resolved. skill-assets/gemini-interactions.md now leads with status.json (quarantined,
  production_routable=false) and the failing receipt (A2_FAIL_DO_NOT_PROMOTE, normalized_delta 0.10 vs
  0.2 threshold, 4 agent failures, metadata_complete=false, shared-cwd contamination), documents what
  the current driver changed and which tests prove it, and discloses that no gate links status.json to
  the receipt.

RQ-05 (vendored operator topology and external dependencies unmodelled)
  Resolved. terminal-operator/overview.md separates vendored-present files, required-but-absent upstream
