.agents/skills/repo-terminal-operator/SKILL.md:54:- Own and close every subprocess, stream, timer, listener, and network handle. Drain streams before awaiting exit; on timeout kill, await termination, and clear the timer in deterministic cleanup.
.agents/skills/repo-terminal-operator/SKILL.md:60:Run `bun run repo-adapter.ts --describe` to inspect this profile and `bun run repo-adapter.ts --preflight <packet.json>` for the fast lease/HEAD/path gate. Use `bun run repo-adapter.ts --run <packet.json>` for the complete repo-local loop: it runs preflight, code-quality, then production-use, blocks production-use after a code-quality failure, and emits the physical `small-loop-run-receipt@v1`. Active admission evidence inside that loop must run through `bun run ../../skills/repo-neural-perception/scripts/writer-contained-production-profile.ts`; it invokes the actual repo-local `writer-entrypoint.ts` inside the OS-contained carrier. The preflight-only `os-contained-production-profile.ts` remains available for diagnosis but cannot admit writer safety. Direct host execution of either journey is invalid for admission. The older `production-journey.ts` is legacy-only and MUST NOT be used for admission.
